# Commits that only reformat, rename or move code (no behaviour change).
# `git blame` skips them with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub's blame view reads this file automatically. Add one full commit hash
# per line, with a comment naming the change.
#
# Only hashes that exist on main work. PRs are squash-merged, so a hash from a
# PR branch never reaches main: land a mechanical change as its own PR and add
# the resulting main commit here in a follow-up PR. (A merge-commit PR keeps
# its commits, so it may list them directly.)
